Source: television
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dario Griffo <dariogriffo@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), wget, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/alexpasmantier/television
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: television
Architecture: amd64 arm64 i386
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: treeviewx
Description: a very fast, portable and hackable fuzzy finder for the terminal
 Television lets you search in real time through any kind of data source
 (called "channels") such as files, code, notes, processes, git repositories,
 environment variables or docker containers, with preview support,
 customizable actions and keybindings, and shell/editor integration.
 .
 The command provided by this package is "tv".
 .
 This package conflicts with treeviewx, which ships the same /usr/bin/tv
 and /usr/share/man/man1/tv.1.gz paths.
